    {
      "kind": "cg",
      "action": "hide"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "第九話　一次錯身的邂逅，一次錯落的交流"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "寒假前。崇基，眾志堂。剛考完。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "zhijun",
      "expr": "05-tearsmile",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "嗨！凌晨，這麼巧啊！"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "lingchen",
      "expr": "05-fire",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "黎芷君！我們還真有緣呀，吃下午茶嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "zhijun",
      "expr": "04-puff",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "好呀，你一個人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "lingchen",
      "expr": "01-shrug",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "是呀。剛剛才考完大通，沒有熟朋友跟我一起修，所以一個人來。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "他往窗邊指。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "zhijun",
      "expr": "01-laugh",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "還是坐外面吧，外面空氣比較通爽。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "兩人坐到外面。桌上爬過蟑螂。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "lingchen",
      "expr": "01-shrug",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "你看，旁邊枱面上就有一隻在吃剩飯。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "zhijun",
      "expr": "02-hips",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "哈哈！好得意啊！"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "小強又不會咬人，又沒過來跟我們搶飯。你這個怕狗怕得要死的人都不怕蟑螂，難道我會被一隻小強嚇到？"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "lingchen",
      "expr": "02-blush",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "真衰，老是翻舊帳。算了，傷心事就別提了。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "jump",
      "to": "ch09-bird"
    }
  ]
}
